# Generated build files
/build/
*.o
*.a
*.so

# Runtime output
/logs/

# Python environment and cache
/.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Local development records (never pushed; kept for report writing).
# These files hold our raw notes and decisions. The IGNORE RULE travels with
# the repo, but the files themselves do not (ignored files are never in git) --
# copy docs/ by hand if the repo is ever moved or re-cloned.
/docs/dev-log.md
/docs/DEVELOPMENT-JOURNAL.md